  "status_summary": "The correct answer is D (YU JU / 豫剧). A strong consensus has already formed around D with 7 colleagues (1, 3, 6, 7, 15, 17, 18) supporting it. Choice C currently has 3 supporters (2, 8, 13), while Choice A has 1 (12) and Choice E has 1 (10). Several colleagues (4, 5, 9, 11, 14, 16) were silent.",
